    "title": "Kyuukyoku Shinka shita Full Dive RPG ga Genjitsu yori mo Kusoge Dattara",
    "title_english": "Full Dive: The Ultimate Next-Gen Full Dive RPG Is Even Shittier than Real Life!",
    "type": "TV",
